# Optional: Kesefly cloud accounts (Supabase Auth).
# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project (Settings > API).
# Leave empty to keep accounts on the phone only (device mode).
# The anon key is public by design; never put the service_role key here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
